<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AI 공부 매니저</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap');
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
:root{--blue:#0f766e;--blue-l:#ecfeff;--blue-d:#115e59;--bg:#f7faf9;--card:#ffffff;--txt:#0f172a;--mut:#5b677a;--bdr:#d8e5e3;--r:18px;--grn:#16a34a;--red:#dc2626;--org:#ea580c;--pur:#7c3aed;--yel:#ca8a04;--ring:0 0 0 3px rgba(15,118,110,.16);--sh:0 20px 50px rgba(8,47,73,.08);--sh-sm:0 8px 24px rgba(8,47,73,.07)}
body{font-family:'Manrope','Noto Sans KR','Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% -10%,#dff9f3 0%,transparent 44%),radial-gradient(circle at 82% -4%,#ffe9d4 0%,transparent 36%),var(--bg);color:var(--txt);min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;transition:background .2s,color .2s;letter-spacing:-.01em}
body.dark{--bg:#04151d;--card:#0d1f2a;--txt:#ecfeff;--mut:#91a7b7;--bdr:#23404f;--blue:#5eead4;--blue-l:rgba(94,234,212,.14);--blue-d:#2dd4bf;--grn:#22c55e;--red:#fb7185;--org:#fb923c;--pur:#a78bfa;--yel:#facc15;--ring:0 0 0 3px rgba(45,212,191,.22);--sh:0 20px 50px rgba(2,12,18,.55);--sh-sm:0 10px 28px rgba(2,12,18,.45)}
.page{display:none!important;visibility:hidden;height:0;overflow:hidden}.page.show{display:block!important;visibility:visible;height:auto;overflow:visible}.page.show.auth-page,.page.show.survey-page,.page.show.dash{display:flex!important}
.btn{padding:10px 20px;border-radius:12px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s,background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}
body.dark .l-nav,body.dark .topb,body.dark .sbar,body.dark .cd,body.dark .acrd,body.dark .scard,body.dark .ais,body.dark .aic,body.dark .gc,body.dark .rk,body.dark .fr{background:var(--card);border-color:var(--bdr);color:var(--txt)}
body.dark .l-nav,body.dark .topb{background:rgba(17,24,39,.86)}
body.dark input,body.dark select,body.dark textarea{background:var(--card);color:var(--txt);border-color:var(--bdr)}
body.dark .overlay{background:rgba(2,6,23,.55)}
.bp{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--blue-d));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(15,118,110,.24)}.bp:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 14px 26px rgba(15,118,110,.28)}
.bg{background:transparent;color:var(--txt)}.bg:hover{background:var(--blue-l);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.bo{background:transparent;color:var(--txt);border:1px solid var(--bdr)}.bo:hover{background:var(--blue-l);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.bs{padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px}
.l-nav{padding:16px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bdr);background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10}
.l-nav .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
.l-nav .logo i{width:32px;height:32px;background:var(--blue);border-radius:10px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-style:normal;font-size:14px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:82px 24px 66px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative}
.hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;width:540px;height:540px;max-width:90vw;max-height:90vw;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(15,118,110,.16) 0%,rgba(15,118,110,0) 70%);filter:blur(20px);z-index:-1;top:12px}
.hero .tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--blue-l);color:var(--blue);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:20px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.06;margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-1.3px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero p{color:var(--mut);font-size:18px;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 32px;line-height:1.6}
.hero .hbtns{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center}
.hero-tree-art{width:min(420px,92vw);margin:28px auto 0;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}
.hero-tree-art svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;filter:drop-shadow(0 18px 28px rgba(15,23,42,.10))}
.feat{border-top:1px solid var(--bdr);padding:60px 24px}
.feat-in{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,280px));justify-content:center;gap:20px}
.fc{padding:24px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--card);transition:box-shadow .3s,transform .3s,border-color .2s}
.fc:hover{box-shadow:var(--sh-sm);transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:rgba(15,118,110,.25)}
.fc .fi{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue-l);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:14px}
.fc h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}
.fc p{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.5}
.title-apple{font-size:.82em;line-height:1;display:inline-block;transform:translateY(2px)}
.l-foot{text-align:center;padding:20px;font-size:12px;color:var(--mut);border-top:1px solid var(--bdr)}
.auth-page{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.abox{width:100%;max-width:400px}
.abox .atxt{text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px}
.abox .atxt div{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--blue);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 12px;font-size:22px;color:#fff}
.abox .atxt h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:700}
.abox .atxt p{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:4px}
.acrd{padding:28px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--card);box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.fg{margin-bottom:16px}
.fg label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.fg input{width:100%;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px solid var(--bdr);font-size:14px;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s,background .2s;outline:none;background:var(--card)}
.fg input:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:var(--ring)}
.err{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);color:var(--red);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:14px;display:none}
.err.show{display:block}
.acrd .btn{width:100%;padding:12px;font-size:14px;border-radius:12px}
.alnk{text-align:center;margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut)}
.alnk a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.survey-page{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.sbox{width:100%;max-width:560px}
.pbar{height:6px;background:var(--bdr);border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:20px;overflow:hidden}
.pbar .pf{height:100%;background:var(--blue);border-radius:4px;transition:width .4s}
.scard{padding:28px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--card);box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.scard h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px}
.opt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px solid var(--bdr);margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;font-size:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.84),rgba(255,255,255,.6))}
body.dark .opt{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(13,31,42,.94),rgba(13,31,42,.82))}
.opt:hover{border-color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue-l)}
.opt.sel{border-color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue-l);color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
.snav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:20px}
.dash{display:flex;min-height:100vh}
.sbar{width:240px;border-right:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--card);display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:fixed;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;z-index:20;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.sbar .sl{padding:16px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bdr)}
.sbar .sl i{width:30px;height:30px;background:var(--blue);border-radius:9px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-style:normal;font-size:12px}
.sbar nav{flex:1;padding:10px;overflow-y:auto}
.sbar nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--mut);text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;margin-bottom:2px;cursor:pointer}
.sbar nav a:hover{background:var(--blue-l);color:var(--txt)}
.sbar nav a.act{background:var(--blue-l);color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
.sbar .sb{border-top:1px solid var(--bdr);padding:10px}
.mbar{margin-left:240px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:100vh}
.topb{height:56px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bdr);background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 24px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10}
.topb .tr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.topb .av{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blue-l);color:var(--blue);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.pcon{padding:24px;flex:1}
.pcon h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:4px}
.pcon .sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin-bottom:20px}
.cd{padding:20px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--card);box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.sgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:20px}
.sc{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.sc .si{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0}
.sc .sv{font-size:20px;font-weight:800}
.sc .sl2{font-size:11px;color:var(--mut)}
.g2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
.g3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
.bdg{display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}
.bdg-b{background:var(--blue-l);color:var(--blue)}
.bdg-g{background:rgba(34,197,94,.1);color:var(--grn)}
.bdg-m{background:var(--blue-l);color:var(--mut)}
.chart{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;height:150px}
.chart .col{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.chart .bw{width:100%;background:var(--blue-l);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;height:100%}
.chart .br{background:var(--blue);border-radius:8px;transition:height .5s}
.chart .dy{font-size:11px;color:var(--mut)}
.todoin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;transition:background .2s;cursor:pointer}
.todoin:hover{background:rgba(15,118,110,.06)}
.tchk{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--bdr);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;transition:all .2s;font-size:12px}
.tchk.dn{border-color:var(--grn);background:var(--grn);color:#fff}
.ttx{flex:1;font-size:14px}
.ttx.dn{text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--mut)}
.tdl{background:none;border:none;color:var(--mut);cursor:pointer;padding:4px;font-size:16px}
.tdl:hover{color:var(--red)}
.prg{height:8px;background:var(--bdr);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}
.prg .bar{height:100%;border-radius:6px;transition:width .5s}
.tcircle{width:220px;height:220px;margin:0 auto 30px;position:relative}
.tcircle svg{width:100%;height:100%;transform:rotate(-90deg)}
.tcircle .tb{fill:none;stroke:var(--bdr);stroke-width:6}
.tcircle .tf{fill:none;stroke:var(--blue);stroke-width:6;stroke-linecap:round;transition:stroke-dashoffset 1s}
.tcircle .tm{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:44px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-2px}
.tbts{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}
.cal-g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:4px}
.cal-h{text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--mut);padding:8px 0}
.cal-d{text-align:center;padding:8px 4px;border-radius:10px;font-size:12px;min-height:60px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s;border:1px solid transparent}
.cal-d:hover{background:var(--blue-l)}
.cal-d.tod{border-color:var(--blue);background:rgba(37,99,235,.04)}
.cal-d .nm{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.cal-ev{font-size:8px;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:4px;color:#fff;margin-top:2px;background:var(--blue);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.fr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;transition:background .2s}
.fr:hover{background:var(--blue-l);transform:translateX(2px)}
.fav{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;position:relative}
.fd{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grn);position:absolute;bottom:-1px;right:-1px;border:2px solid var(--card)}
.gc{padding:20px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--card);transition:box-shadow .2s,transform .2s,border-color .2s}
.gc:hover{box-shadow:var(--sh-sm);transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:rgba(15,118,110,.22)}
.rk{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:16px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--card);margin-bottom:10px;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.rk.me{border-color:var(--blue);background:rgba(15,118,110,.06)}
.rkn{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;min-width:36px;text-align:center}
.ais{padding:24px;border-radius:var(--r);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(15,118,110,.08),rgba(234,88,12,.08));border:1px solid rgba(15,118,110,.18);margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:var(--sh-sm)}
.ais .ar{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start}
.ais .aii{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(37,99,235,.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;flex-shrink:0}
.ais h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}
.ais p{font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.6}
.aic{padding:20px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--card)}
.aic h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px}
.aig{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.aig.gr{background:rgba(34,197,94,.07);border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.2)}
.aig.yl{background:rgba(234,179,8,.08);border:1px solid rgba(234,179,8,.22)}
.aig p:first-child{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.aig p:last-child{font-size:12px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:2px}
.srow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bdr)}
.srow:last-child{border:none}
.srow .slf p:first-child{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
.srow .slf p:last-child{font-size:12px;color:var(--mut)}
.tgl{width:44px;height:24px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--bdr);cursor:pointer;position:relative;transition:background .2s}
.tgl.on{background:var(--blue)}
.tgl::after{content:'';width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;transition:transform .2s;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}
.tgl.on::after{transform:translateX(20px)}
.tbl{overflow-x:auto}
table{width:100%;font-size:13px;border-collapse:collapse}
th{text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--mut);border-bottom:1px solid var(--bdr)}
td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bdr)}
tr:hover{background:rgba(15,118,110,.05)}
.menu-btn{display:none;background:none;border:none;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer;padding:4px}
.overlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);z-index:15}
.overlay.show{display:block}
@media(max-width:768px){.sbar{transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .3s}.sbar.open{transform:translateX(0)}.mbar{margin-left:0}.g2,.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.hero h1{font-size:28px}.hero{padding-top:64px}.menu-btn{display:block!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="pg-land" class="page show">
  <nav class="l-nav">
    <div class="logo"><i>&#128214;</i> AI 공부 매니저</div>
    <div><button id="headerLoginBtn" class="btn bg" type="button">로그인</button> <button id="headerSignupBtn" class="btn bp" type="button">회원가입</button></div>
  </nav>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="tag">&#129504; AI 기반 학습 관리</div>
    <h1><span>AI 공부 매니저</span><span class="title-apple" aria-hidden="true">&#127823;</span></h1>
    <p>AI가 당신의 학습 패턴을 분석하고 최적화된 학습 계획을 제안합니다.</p>
    <div class="hbtns">
      <button id="startBtn" type="button" class="btn bp" style="padding:14px 36px;font-size:15px">시작하기 &#8594;</button>
      <button id="browseBtn" type="button" class="btn bo" style="padding:14px 36px;font-size:15px">둘러보기</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="feat"><div class="feat-in">
    <div class="fc"><div class="fi">&#129504;</div><h3>AI 학습 분석</h3><p>공부 시간과 진척도를 바탕으로 개인 맞춤형 분석을 제공합니다.</p></div>
    <div class="fc"><div class="fi">&#9201;</div><h3>스마트 타이머</h3><p>포모도로 기반 공부 타이머로 집중 시간을 바로 기록할 수 있습니다.</p></div>
    <div class="fc"><div class="fi">&#127919;</div><h3>목표 관리</h3><p>구체적인 목표와 마감일을 등록해 학습 흐름을 꾸준히 관리하세요.</p></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="l-foot">&copy; 2026 AI 공부 매니저</div>
</div>

<div id="pg-login" class="page auth-page">
  <div class="abox">
    <div class="atxt"><div>&#128214;</div><h2>로그인</h2><p>AI 공부 매니저에 로그인하세요</p></div>
    <div class="acrd">
      <div id="lerr" class="err"></div>
      <div class="fg"><label>이메일</label><input type="email" id="lemail" placeholder="example@email.com"></div>
      <div class="fg"><label>아이디</label><input type="text" id="lid" placeholder="사용할 아이디 입력"></div>
      <div class="fg"><label>비밀번호</label><input type="password" id="lpw" placeholder="비밀번호 입력"></div>
      <button class="btn bp" onclick="doLogin()">로그인</button>
      <div class="alnk">계정이 없으신가요? <a onclick="go('pg-signup')">회원가입</a></div>
      <div class="alnk"><a onclick="showFindId()">아이디 찾기</a> · <a onclick="showFindPassword()">비밀번호 찾기</a></div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:16px"><a style="font-size:12px;color:var(--mut);cursor:pointer" onclick="go('pg-land')">&#8592; 홈으로</a></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="pg-signup" class="page auth-page">
  <div class="abox">
    <div class="atxt"><div>&#128214;</div><h2>회원가입</h2><p>AI 공부 매니저 계정을 만드세요</p></div>
    <div class="acrd">
      <div id="serr" class="err"></div>
      <div class="fg"><label>본명</label><input type="text" id="sname" placeholder="홍길동"></div>
